[B]NeoModeration 1.2.2[/B]

This reliability and performance update is recommended for every server.

[B]Fixed[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Paper chat is now moderated exactly once, preventing duplicate API usage and duplicate punishments.
[*]Map-art scanning now reads the real nested map data used by Minecraft.
[*][FONT=Courier New]failOpen: false[/FONT] now works for cloud timeouts, authentication failures, and circuit-breaker pauses.
[*]The bypass permission now applies to map-art checks too.
[*]Failed map-art scans are retried instead of being cached as successful.
[*]Empty URL rules can no longer match every chat message.
[*]Cloud timeout defaults now match the 2.5-second maximum chat wait.
[/LIST]

[B]Faster[/B]
[LIST]
[*]The offline word filter now compiles its rules once per configuration.
[*]A real 403-word test corpus runs at about 8.5 microseconds per message — over 100x faster than the previous path.
[/LIST]

[B]Verified[/B]
[LIST]
[*]44 automated tests passed.
[*]Paper 1.18.2, 1.19.4, 1.20.6, and 1.21.11 all passed the release matrix.
[*]Every tested Paper version confirmed exactly one moderation action per flagged message.
[/LIST]
